<section image-layout="blank" id="ILAB69lNX1"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="2AzXksURyT" padding="0" colspan="24"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/sMcA5Bjv27wPqxxdMMRLv.png" saved-media-id="dr3hk9auh08yv0i" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, a non-documentary literary figure representing Thúy Kiều seated beside a stringed instrument at the left of the frame, alert and self-possessed while architectural screens narrow behind her, quiet open field on the right, Vietnamese manuscript and woodblock sensibility, lampblack, vermilion, old gold and indigo, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"></grid-item><grid-item id="sFwcG1CEzO" vertical-align="center" colspan="36"><p role="eyebrow">Character study</p><h2>Thúy Kiều: gifted, ethical, constrained</h2><p font-size="18pt">Artistically gifted and emotionally perceptive, Kiều acts decisively inside social and material limits that keep narrowing.</p><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="-rNdB-Ohan" background-color="accent" padding="12pt 16pt"><h3 font-size="19pt">Her agency is real—but never exercised on equal terms.</h3></grid-item></grid><p role="eyebrow">Choice field narrows →</p><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="wpt3a9PVDy" background-color="surface" cell-decor="side-line" padding="10pt 12pt" colspan="22"><h4>Love</h4><p font-size="16pt">A future she actively values.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="-Ra39MxZzs" background-color="surface" cell-decor="side-line" padding="10pt 12pt" colspan="20"><h4>Filial duty</h4><p font-size="16pt">She exchanges that future for family safety.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="XHQkv2CPeB" background-color="surface" cell-decor="side-line" padding="10pt 12pt" colspan="18"><h4>Survival</h4><p font-size="16pt">Compromise, trust, resistance, or flight.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid><box type="content" x="24" y="492" w="300" h="30" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt 8pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="12pt"><b>Interpretive illustration—not documentary evidence.</b></p></box></section>